  "title": "CONSTRUCTION OF IRREDUCIBLE REPRESENTATIONS OVER KHOVANOV-LAUDA-ROUQUIER ALGEBRAS",
  "authors_raw": "OF FINITE CLASSICAL TYPE",
  "title_lines": [
   "CONSTRUCTION OF IRREDUCIBLE REPRESENTATIONS",
   "OVER KHOVANOV-LAUDA-ROUQUIER ALGEBRAS"
  ],
  "abstract": "We give an explicit construction of irreducible modules over Khovanov-Lauda- Rouquier algebras R and their cyclotomic quotients Rλ for ﬁnite classical types using a crystal basis theoretic approach. More precisely, for each element v of the crystal B(∞) (resp. B(λ)), we ﬁrst construct certain modules ∆(a; k) labeled by the adapted string a of v. We then prove that the head of the induced module Ind \u0000∆(a; 1)⊠· · ·⊠∆(a; n) \u0001 is irreducible and that every irreducible R-module (resp. Rλ-module) can be realized as the irreducible head of one of the induced modules Ind(∆(a; 1) ⊠· · · ⊠∆(a; n)). Moreover, we show that our construction is compatible with the crystal structure on B(∞) (resp. B(λ)).",
  "docinfo": {
